.TH DICTO 1 "September 2026" "dicto 0.6" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dicto \- fast, offline desktop dictionary for MDX/MDD files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dicto
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dicto
is a native desktop dictionary application that reads MDX/MDD
dictionary files \(em the format used by GoldenDict and MDict.
It provides instant search as you type, faithful HTML rendering with
per-dictionary CSS, multi-dictionary management (enable, disable, and
reorder without restarting), and a built-in dictionary downloader.
It works fully offline.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-translate
Start in quick-translate mode.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/dicto/dicts/
Dictionary directory. Place
.I .mdx
(and optional
.IR .mdd )
files here; they are discovered and indexed automatically on the next
launch. Dictionaries downloaded from within the app are installed
here too.
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/logi-camp/dicto
